 across at least two generations? If yes -> instantiates. Step 2 -- if the work only depicts, critiques, or thematizes the phenomenon, or trains on human-authored material (even the artist's own prior writing) without a demonstrable model-generation-to-model-generation loop -> references only. Ambiguous or incompletely disclosed cases -> qualifies, assessed individually, never force-fit into either bucket.", "scope_note": "Applied here (task-packets/K1-T04.yaml) to the 15 works-atlas entries whose own `clusters` array contains 7 (\\"AI self-consumption\\"); each classification's basis is recorded in corpora/model-collapse/corpus-entries.json's own `extraction.classification_basis` field, quoting the exact `decisive_move` text it rests on."}], "revision": 1, "created_at": "2026-07-21T07:36:39.474770Z", "created_by": "urn:mrr:agent-role:01KY1SNY86X0GDE2N9TVZKT4YD", "api_version": "mrr/v1alpha1", "practice_id": "urn:mrr:practice:01KY1SNY86X0GDE2N9TVZKT4YF", "content_hash": "sha256:72b4f0f0de2b82d805afba009f3fa6c0280b12317c329605c9d34b85a58ab27c"}
